      "summaries": {
        "en": "Last30days-skill is an AI agent that researches trending topics across platforms like Reddit, X, and YouTube to generate grounded summaries, addressing information overload by filtering recent, relevant content. It works by aggregating data from diverse sources including social media and prediction markets, then synthesizes insights using AI to highlight key trends and discussions. You can use it to track emerging topics in your field, experiment by customizing source inputs, or integrate it into workflows for automated research and analysis.",
        "zh": "Last30days-skill 是一个 AI 智能体，专门研究 Reddit、X、YouTube 等平台上的热门话题，生成基于事实的摘要，帮助用户应对信息过载问题。它通过聚合社交媒体和预测市场等多源数据，利用 AI 技术筛选近期内容并综合关键趋势与讨论。使用时，你可以用它追踪所在领域的新兴话题，通过自定义数据源进行实验，或将其集成到工作流中实现自动化研究，从而快速获取有价值的洞察。",
        "es": "Last30days-skill is an AI agent that researches trending topics across platforms like Reddit, X, and YouTube to generate grounded summaries, addressing information overload by filtering recent, relevant content. It works by aggregating data from diverse sources including social media and prediction markets, then synthesizes insights using AI to highlight key trends and discussions. You can use it to track emerging topics in your field, experiment by customizing source inputs, or integrate it into workflows for automated research and analysis.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "last30days-skill stands out for ai-prompts, ai-skill, and bluesky in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Last30days-skill is an AI agent that researches trending topics across platforms like Reddit, X, and YouTube to generate grounded summaries, addressing information overload by filtering recent, relevant content. It works by aggregating data from diverse sources including social media and prediction markets, then synthesizes insights using AI to highlight key trends and discussions. You can use it to track emerging topics in your field, experiment by customizing source inputs, or integrate it into workflows for automated research and analysis.",
